    <record id="base.main_company" model="res.company">
        <field name="rental_terms" type="html"><p>The customer takes care of the rented products and returns them clean, complete and on time.
Late returns are charged per extra hour or day. Damages and missing parts are charged at repair or replacement cost.</p></field>
